# Formspree — contact form submissions go to your email
# 1. Go to https://formspree.io and sign up (free).
# 2. Create a new form; set the notification email to: fortivex.support@gmail.com
# 3. Copy your form ID from the form URL (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xyzabc → xyzabc).
# 4. Create a file named .env in this directory and add:
#    VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=xyzabc
# 5. Restart the dev server (npm run dev).
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
